			"text": "Narrated Al-Bara:that regarding Allah's saying: Allah will keep firm those who believe, with the word that stands firm in this world and in the Hereafter (14:27). The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"In the grave, when it is said to him: 'Who is your Lord? What is your religion? And who is your Prophet?",
